WEBVTT

00:00:58.621 --> 00:01:00.162
These essential fatty acids,

00:01:00.204 --> 00:01:03.412
which have been linked to preventing
degenerative brain conditions,

00:01:03.454 --> 00:01:06.329
must come from our diets.

00:01:06.371 --> 00:01:08.288
So eating omega-rich foods,

00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:10.621
such as nuts, seeds,
and fatty fish,

00:01:10.663 --> 00:01:15.454
is crucial to the creation
and maintenance of cell membranes.

00:01:15.621 --> 00:01:18.454
And while omegas are good fats
for your brain,

00:01:18.496 --> 00:01:22.621
long-term consumption of other fats,
such as trans and saturated fats,

00:01:22.663 --> 00:01:25.121
may compromise brain health.

00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:28.496
Meanwhile, proteins and amino acids,

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:31.663
the building block nutrients
of growth and development,